/ActualText (Establish Operational Standards for Cooling Centers: Work with partners to develop and enact clear operational guidelines and protocols for activating cooling centers during peak heat times. Enhance visibility and awareness by creating consistent signage and online presence for all cooling center locations in the region.)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [10]
