<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Enhance Accessibility and Accommodations: Optimize the placement and operational hours of cooling centers based on available data \(i.e. heat risk, exposure data, 911-heat-related calls\) to better serve community members with access and functional needs. Ensure these centers are accessible to seniors, individuals with disabilities, and those without transportation. Enhance physical accommodations to include wheelchair access and pet-friendly policies where possible, offer family-friendly amenities, and explore providing storage options for personal property. )
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
