/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Update Zoning and Building Codes: Review zoning laws and building codes to encourage heat-resilient design in new constructions or major renovations. Considerations should include building shape, massing, and orientation, along with the use of reflective materials like cool roofs. Enhancements should incorporate green infrastructure such as green roofs, vertical greening, adequate onsite shade, permeable pavement, and effective thermal insulations to improve microclimate management. )
/Pg 48 0 R
/K [7]
>>
