/T (The Heat Relief Network is a regional partnership of Pima County, tribal nations, municipalities, nonprofit organizations, the faith-based community, and businesses. Each year, the HRN coordinates the mapping of heat relief locations, water stations, splash pads, public water fountains, and water donation sites throughout Pima County with the goal of preventing heat-related illnesses and deaths among vulnerable populations.)
